==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Icy Lizalfos Tails are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by [[Ice-Breath Lizalfos]], who can be found in mountainous regions of [[Hyrule]], upon their deaths. Though they have hard scales and flesh, which makes them unsuitable for cooking, they can be put in a [[Cooking Pot]] with critters to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Blue [[Dye]] or sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] in exchange for [[Mon]].

The [[Desert Voe Set]] requires Icy Lizalfos Tails to be upgraded to their third and fourth tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
